,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.9125,0,8,0,0,63,0Style: Italics-furigana,Open Sans Semibold,40.5,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00020713,&H00000000,-1,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.9125,0,2,0,0,63,0Style: OS-furigana,Open Sans Semibold,37,&H00FFFFFF,&H0000FFFF,&H00000000,&H7F404040,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.25,1.125,8,2,2,45,0Style: Default-furigana,Open Sans Semibold,40.5,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00020713,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.9125,0,2,0,0,63,1Style: Default,Open Sans Semibold,81,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00020713,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.825,0,2,0,0,63,1Style: OS,Open Sans Semibold,74,&H00FFFFFF,&H0000FFFF,&H00000000,&H7F404040,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.5,2.25,8,2,2,45,0Style: Italics,Open Sans Semibold,81,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00020713,&H00000000,-1,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.825,0,2,0,0,63,0Style: On Top,Open Sans Semibold,81,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00020713,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.825,0,8,0,0,63,0Style: DefaultLow,Open Sans Semibold,81,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00020713,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.825,0,2,0,0,63,0Style: Karaoke,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,23,23,23,1Style: Translation,Duality,55,&H008C3C52,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,23,23,23,1Style: Kanji,Duality,55,&H008C3C52,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,130,1Style: Secondary,Impress BT,55,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,1.5,2,120,120,18,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: HorribleSubsScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:40.85,Title,,0,0,0,,Way of LifeDialogue: 0,0:01:43.56,0:01:45.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Rainfall Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.95,0:02:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it! He went right back to being strong again!Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.12,0:02:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:06.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Kong...Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.99,0:02:08.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:14.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.51,0:02:16.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Power Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:31.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,Within Totto Land, At SeaDialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:31.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,The SunnyDialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:31.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You changed your clothes.Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.66,0:02:36.11,Main,,0,0,0,,It's quiet...Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:38.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Almost too quiet...Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:44.66,Main,,0,0,0,,All clear!Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:48.78,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, there's no way they'll let us escape this easily.Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:51.59,Main,,0,0,0,,The pride of an Emperor is at stake.Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Even so...Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:57.59,Main,,0,0,0,,our only option is to keep moving forward!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:02:58.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:02.39,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, we need to get back on the straight course we were on earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:10.38,Main,,0,0,0,,If we can't meet up with Sanji-kun and the others, who are bringing the cake...Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:13.08,Main,,0,0,0,,not only will we remain separated...Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,we will face Big Mom's fury like the scorn of Hell itself.Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:33.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,Also At SeaDialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,To all the islands of Totto Land!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.09,0:03:38.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Dispatch all of the Tarte ships from each island immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:42.89,Main,,0,0,0,,To save the Big Mom Pirates' prestige,Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:47.27,Main,,0,0,0,,go after these three hateful pirate groups!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.27,0:03:54.11,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat crew, who wrecked havoc upon us, the Big Mom Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:57.02,Main,,0,0,0,,And the group that stood beside them!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:04:02.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The Fire Tank Pirates, who betrayed our queen, Big Mom...Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:04.37,Main,,0,0,0,,and plotted to assassinate her!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.37,0:04:09.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Along with the missing Fishmen, the allies of the "Knight of the Sea", Jinbe...Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,who rebelled against us...Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:15.09,Main,,0,0,0,,the Sun Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:21.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Those pirates are currently in the midst of escaping on the seas of Totto Land!Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:26.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going to search for them? What happened to the Territorial Sea Slugs?Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:29.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard they went missing.Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:31.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:35.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Do not allow them to leave our territory!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:39.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Find them at all costs...Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:45.01,Main,,0,0,0,,and sink... every last one of them... as soon as you find them!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:49.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.50,0:04:53.24,Main,,0,0,0,,What you just confirmed...Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:59.17,Main,,0,0,0,,is that I am invincible as long as I remain calm, right?Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:05.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll drop your guard again! You're an enemy...Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:08.22,Main,,0,0,0,,that I can beat!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:10.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're about to shrivel up?Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:14.47,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Gear Fourth's time limit is up!Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:16.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm done for now!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:21.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for warning me!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to use Haki for 10 minutes!Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.02,0:05:27.53,Main,,0,0,0,,So I have to get as far away as I can!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:30.55,Main,,0,0,0,,So, it's a power up with a time limit?Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.55,0:05:32.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Flowing Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be naive of me to just let you go!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:47.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:52.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I just need 10 minutes!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:54.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Without Haki, there's no way I can beat him!Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:58.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no good! I can't lose him!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:06:01.29,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad! Really bad!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,How disappointing. Is this really the end already?Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:16.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:20.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,Cacao Island (Chocolat Town)Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:22.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sweets FactoryDialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What just happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong? Are you okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:30.95,Main,,0,0,0,,All he did was taste the whipped cream...Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.96,0:06:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me it was poisoned...!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:34.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:39.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you ask him?Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.97,0:06:42.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I could die right now...Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:46.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I could die happily because of how delicious this is!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:49.34,Main,,0,0,0,,He almost died from tasting something delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:51.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Look how happy he is!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,That whipped cream is Sanji-san's secret ingredient!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The true power of sweetness!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:03.23,Main,,0,0,0,,It's finished!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:07.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The ultimate cream, Simsim Whip!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I wanna try it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:13.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan, you can't taste it yet...Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:14.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.42,0:07:19.05,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to lose a dependable ally like you.Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:25.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't fall before you even taste it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:34.65,Main,,0,0,0,,If this cream were to be spread on a cake...Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:38.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think about it! You'll die!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:49.08,Main,,0,0,0,,My fluffy chiffon cake is finished, too, Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold it down! It's so fluffy that it's gonna float away!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,My part is finished, too!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:03.28,Main,,0,0,0,,In addition to Sanji-san's whipped cream....Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:07.85,Main,,0,0,0,,we've got my super-sweet and super-velvety chocolate!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.47,0:08:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Put a lid on it! It's smooth enough to come flying out of the pot!Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:22.28,Main,,0,0,0,,In 5 minutes, it'll be 6 PM.Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:25.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything's going according to plan.Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:29.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Is the ship ready?Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:30.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:35.04,Main,,0,0,0,,To save time, we'll finish the cake on the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:40.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's rendezvous with the Sunny as soon as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:42.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:43.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,It's finally time!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.93,0:08:52.60,Main,,0,0,0,,To take down the one causing trouble for my friends... Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:00.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Husband-sama, why are you in disguise?Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I'm shy.Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:14.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Make way, everyone! We're transporting the cake to the port!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:18.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing! They made it that fast?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,The shape of the cake is complete!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:22.23,Main,,0,0,0,,And it smells really good!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:27.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Once it's complete, I'm sure Mama will love it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:31.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What a blissful aroma! Are we in Heaven?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected of Pudding-sama and Chiffon-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:40.91,Main,,0,0,0,,And the WCI: 31!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:46.09,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Mama's coming!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.09,0:09:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We need to move quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama! Chiffon-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.25,0:09:53.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.60,0:09:57.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Big Mom...Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:01.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You will taste the ultimate cake!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:16.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Power Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:52.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that Brûlée?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:11:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Help! Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:04.24,Secondary,,0,0,0,,You fool!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:05.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Why were you over there?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:09.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.05,0:11:13.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:16.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:26.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:28.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are we?Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:30.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Branch!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.31,Main,,0,0,0,,The name's Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:34.96,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, let's wait here...Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:37.33,Main,,0,0,0,,for a bit, until my Haki comes back!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:51.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:10.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:25.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, stop! This is the island I govern!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:28.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! This is Nuts Island!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.37,0:12:32.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Neither the cake nor Straw Hat are here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you?! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom?Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.95,0:12:56.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! That must be my daughter!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:13:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon! It's no mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:05.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:09.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:12.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Oven! Please get out of our way!Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:16.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding, where are you taking that cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:19.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I was told that you were going to wait for the Straw Hats...Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:22.83,Main,,0,0,0,,along with Mama, who is having Hunger Pangs, on this island.Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.03,0:13:28.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll finish the cake on the ship and stop Mama at sea!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.79,Main,,0,0,0,,At sea?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want us to let a rampaging Mama land at Chocolat Town?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:38.05,Main,,0,0,0,,If we contact Brother Peros, we can arrange a meetup at sea!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:57.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand. My dear little sister, you may pass!Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:14:01.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! Thank you, Big Brother Oven!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.99,0:14:03.53,Main,,0,0,0,,But, Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:09.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You're staying right here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:15.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, how cruel, Oven-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:17.96,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you do that to your little sister?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:25.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It's none of your concern! This is a family dispute!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.85,0:14:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Let them take the cake to the port!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:33.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:36.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon-chan...Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:38.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon...Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:42.82,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you show your face in front of me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:47.03,Main,,0,0,0,,You know what your husband plotted...Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:49.54,Main,,0,0,0,,don't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:15:01.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you're family, your betrayal is inexcusable!Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.35,0:15:06.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Brother Oven!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:08.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Pudding-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.43,0:15:11.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If you do anything, you'll be deemed a traitor, too!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:16.90,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Ah! He's worried about me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:23.70,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But... I can't reveal myself and fight, either...Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:30.26,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What should I do?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.86,0:15:42.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm... already determined...!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.53,0:15:47.99,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,My debt won't be fully repaid until Nami and the others leave safely!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:55.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll... help make the cake until it's finished, Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.21,0:16:03.09,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They saved Lola's life... I cannot fulfill my debt like this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:11.48,Main,,0,0,0,,This is neither a simple fight between siblings nor a rebellious phase, Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:15.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You are a traitor who plotted to kill the queen!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:23.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd have to kill my own sister...Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:26.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:29.78,Main,,0,0,0,,We need to set an example for the others in this country!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:31.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:35.57,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is bad... Maybe I shouldn't be worried about the consequences right now!Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:42.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off of Chiffon! Oven-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:45.30,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll save you right now, my dear daughter!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's that?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard! I should've thrown you out to sea!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I don't know who that guy is...Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:23.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,but I better just save her so quickly...Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.59,0:17:26.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,that nobody sees me!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:35.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? What?Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:37.53,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fly, Chiffon-chan.Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.53,0:17:38.24,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:50.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Did he just knock Oven-sama down?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.84,0:17:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that old man?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:57.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger than I thought?Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:59.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Chiffon?Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.10,0:18:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way that was you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:08.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Who was that just now?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:10.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Leg...Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.27,0:18:12.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You're safe now, Chiffon-chan.Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:14.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:16.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister, you need to hide!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:18.45,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:21.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry to the port!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:26.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Make way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:32.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Leg saved me...Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:34.51,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Who was that big guy?Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:19:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,There you are, Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:03.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Brother Oven!Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:04.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You little...Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:10.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! We need Sister Chiffon in order to finish the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! Get your hands off of Chiffon...Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.30,0:19:22.64,Main,,0,0,0,,She's more than just an ungrateful child...Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:26.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll burn you to the bone!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess I gotta go out there!Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:32.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.05,0:19:34.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:35.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.41,0:19:37.01,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:39.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven-sama, we found Bege's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:43.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It's currently heading towards Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.98,0:19:48.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Our fleet is in pursuit! We'll force them to land at the port!Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.55,0:19:51.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege! You're kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:58.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought he was a cold-hearted man, but he's come to rescue you, eh?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:00.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Bege?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:06.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:09.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me! Oven!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I just caught your accomplice, Chiffon, on Cacao Island.Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:18.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.29,0:20:18.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Rero?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,The Madam was captured?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:25.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Right now, we are heading towards the port from the town!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,So you and your men should come straight to the port...Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:31.00,Captions,,1060,0,325,,Cacao Island, In Front of the PortDialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:31.01,Main,,0,0,0,,and surrender yourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.97,0:20:35.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I am a man who's faithful to the law.Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:39.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't be lenient just because she's my little sister.Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:43.46,Main,,0,0,0,,If you try anything funny, then that'll be the end for her.Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:44.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Rero?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:47.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege! Everyone! Just turn around and run!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I came here out of my selfishness! If you get caught, we'll all be executed anyway!Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:59.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys should save yourselves, at least!Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:03.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama hates me..Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:08.45,Main,,0,0,0,,And you guys are...Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,my only real family!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why, someday...Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:32.33,Main,,0,0,0,,you should avenge me!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.50,0:21:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam, what are you saying?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:41.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:49.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop talking nonsense!Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:50.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.65,0:21:53.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:56.52,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll arrive at the port soon!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:22:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll disembark as you've requested...Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:02.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.99,0:22:06.74,Main,,0,0,0,,So don't lay another hand on Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.41,0:22:08.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Darling...Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:16.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You're too soft, Bege.Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:19.69,Main,,0,0,0,,That's going to cost you your head!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:24.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege's ship is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:27.70,Main,,0,0,0,,All soldiers! Get into a defensive formation!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet! Split up to the right and to the left... and block all escape routes!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:35.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:46.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see Bege's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.32,0:22:50.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess he really is going to surrender without a fight, as he promised.Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.36,0:22:53.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven-sama's carriage is almost to the port!Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:56.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.43,0:22:57.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.03,0:22:58.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?! Brûlée?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.87,0:23:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sister Amande!Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.40,0:23:04.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! The pirate... Straw Hat Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.27,0:23:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.98,0:23:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, look! Straw Hat is right there!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.74,0:23:12.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.94,0:23:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Why's Big Mom here?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.39,0:23:18.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought she was chasing the Sunny on the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.78,0:23:21.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Help me, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.55,0:23:40.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.35,0:23:46.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! She's coming this way!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! Where is my cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you I don't know!Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.69,0:23:58.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, Brother Peros! Help me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.07,0:23:59.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of her!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.75,0:24:02.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Candy Wall!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:11.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Third!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.92,0:24:21.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Giant Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.85,0:24:30.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no good! I can't break it without using Haki!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.27,0:24:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.15,0:24:37.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It's surrounding us!Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.45,0:24:44.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow Waltz!Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.83,0:24:48.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Yikes!Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.62,0:24:51.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sister! Don't cut me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.61,0:24:59.55,Main,,0,0,0,,My Named Blade, Shirauo, is craving blood... I'll make you suffer before you die.Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.55,0:25:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't fight you guys right now!Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.06,0:25:16.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirror! Mirror!Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.22,0:25:19.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Peros!Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.07,0:25:21.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Your candy is in my way!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.39,0:25:23.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Candy Slug!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.12,0:25:35.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.50,0:25:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake!Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.92,0:25:41.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to keep running until I regain my Haki!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.06,0:25:52.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.58,0:25:55.05,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake!Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.93,0:26:03.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Peros, stop her! This is my town!Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.60,0:26:07.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, you're way out of line! You're wrecking the town!Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.06,0:26:14.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.40,0:26:29.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! The town was completely destroyed!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.71,0:26:41.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Where did Straw Hat go?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.38,0:26:46.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Man, that was really close!Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.88,0:26:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,But if Big Mom is here, that means...Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.04,0:26:55.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami and the others got away safely earlier, right?Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.20,0:27:01.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,At Sea - The SunnyDialogue: 0,0:27:03.57,0:27:04.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Ships!Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.92,0:27:08.28,Main,,0,0,0,,The Big Mom Pirates are catching up to us!Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.28,0:27:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger! It's finally time!Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.64,0:27:13.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! Running away is dull!Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.55,0:27:14.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's fight them!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:18.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to us! Let's do it, Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.52,0:27:22.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot?Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.88,0:27:39.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot! I found you!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.66,0:27:42.91,Main,,0,0,0,,A big battle is about to start!Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.22,0:27:46.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chobro.Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.89,0:27:47.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.77,0:27:55.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder... if it'll be a full moon tonight...Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.48,0:27:57.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmmm?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.71,0:28:20.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.73,0:28:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Those fools...Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.57,0:28:51.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We did it! Father!Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.18,0:28:56.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Burn this into your eyes, Pez.Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.65,0:29:02.98,Main,,0,0,0,,This ish Papa's way of life.Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.98,0:29:06.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.78,0:29:14.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Good job!Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.74,0:29:18.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Now what are you gonna do?! I'll follow your lead, Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.36,0:29:30.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody, help!Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.10,0:29:31.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, Branch!Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.34,0:29:32.65,Main,,0,0,0,,The name's Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.14,0:29:36.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,Chips TownDialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:36.34,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Chips Town! Straw Hat Luffy is here!Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.35,0:29:42.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:29:37.55,0:29:39.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.15,0:29:42.86,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Chockfull Town!Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.86,0:29:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat has been spotted!Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.46,0:29:48.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Now he's in Chockfull Town?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.31,0:29:53.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:29:48.70,0:29:53.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is emerging in different places! It looks like he's running around the Mirro-world!Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.23,0:29:57.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Did Big Sister Brûlée get caught again?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.14,0:29:59.73,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Green Town!Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.73,0:30:07.14,Main,,0,0,0,,We have received calls from multiple private residences reporting that they saw someone suspicious!Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.42,0:30:18.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! If you wanna escape, why don't you go to Cacao Island already?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.54,0:30:20.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What? How do you know about that?Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.93,0:30:24.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I eavesdropped! Everyone knows now!Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.58,0:30:26.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that true?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.39,0:30:30.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Just give up! You can't beat my brother!Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.61,0:30:39.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Haki depletes as you use it...Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.12,0:30:49.67,Main,,0,0,0,,If that guy's in a long, drawn-out fight...  then his Observation Haki will definitely weaken!Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.20,0:30:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You look like an idiot, but you're a smart fighter.Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.13,0:30:58.51,Main,,0,0,0,,But... that's not good enough!Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.31,0:31:03.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.73,0:31:05.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I've trained you...Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.78,0:31:12.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,but Haki is something that fully blooms in the heat of a real battle.Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.20,0:31:18.24,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,By confronting strong enemies... you will progressively get stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.08,0:31:26.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's possible for me to see slightly ahead into the future, too.Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?! Don't get carried away, you pipsqueak!Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.85,0:31:45.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to surpass him!Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.07,0:31:59.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to beat him at full power!Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.41,0:32:03.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The...Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.08,0:32:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,one billion Belly man!Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.33,0:32:11.36,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.52,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,YDialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,WDialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue